            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 3,
        "original": "「……さん」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「......san」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 4,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 5,
        "original": "「ふぅぅ～……」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Fuuu~......」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "original": "「もうっ！いい加減にしてくださいっ！」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ihh！ Cukup, dong！」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "original": "「わぁぁぁ！？……って、なんだ、二乃かよ。いきなり大声出すなよ。心臓が止まるかと思っただろ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Waaa！？ ......Kirain siapa, ternyata Nino. Jangan tiba-tiba teriak gitu dong. Jantungku rasanya mau copot, tahu」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "original": "「いきなりじゃありません。さっきから話しかけているのに、全然返事をしてくれないからです」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Ini gak tiba-tiba. Soalnya dari tadi aku panggil, Nii-san gak jawab sama sekali」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "original": "「そ、そうか。それは……すまん」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「O-oh, gitu ya. Kalau itu...... maaf」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "original": "「それに……なんですか、それ？何で今日に限って、そんなにため息ばっかり」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Lagipula...... ada apa sih? Kenapa khusus hari ini Nii-san helah napas terus?」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "original": "そんな自覚はなかったけど、二乃が眉をつり上げて指摘するぐらいだ。相当なのだろう。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Aku tidak menyadarinya, tapi melihat Nino sampai mengangkat alisnya seperti itu, sepertinya aku sudah melakukannya berkali-kali.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "original": "心当たりはひとつしかない。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hanya ada satu hal yang terpikirkan olehku.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "original": "俺と額をくっつけても、そら姉は顔色ひとつ変えなかった。つまり、俺のことを男として少しも意識してないということ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Bahkan saat menempelkan dahi denganku pun, Sora-nee sama sekali tidak berubah ekspresi. Artinya, dia sedikit pun tidak menganggapku sebagai seorang pria.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "original": "今までずっと弟扱いだったんだから、当然といえば当然だ。俺だって家族だと思って、今まで過ごしてきた。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Karena selama ini aku selalu diperlakukan sebagai adik, itu adalah hal yang wajar. Aku pun selama ini menjalani hidup dengan menganggapnya sebagai keluarga.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "original": "いや、もしかしたら、家族だと思おうとしてきたのかもしれない。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Tidak, atau mungkin, aku hanya mencoba untuk terus menganggapnya sebagai keluarga.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "original": "『女の子として見るなら本命はどっち？』",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "『Kalau melihat mereka sebagai cewek, siapa pilihan utamamu？』",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "original": "そんな有里栖の一言で、そら姉の顔が浮かんでしまったのは、きっとそういうことなんだろうと思う。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Gara-gara ucapan Arisu itu, wajah Sora-nee langsung terbayang. Kurasa itu sudah cukup membuktikan segalanya.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "original": "まずはそれを認めてみたとする。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Mari kita coba akui hal itu terlebih dahulu.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "original": "でも、それでどうなる？",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Tapi, lalu kenapa？",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "original": "……好きだって告白したら、少しは男として意識されるか？",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "......Kalau aku menyatakan cinta, apakah dia akan mulai menganggapku sebagai pria？",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "original": "けど、告白が失敗したら？",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Namun, bagaimana kalau pengakuanku gagal？",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "original": "今の、この関係すら失うかもしれない。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Hubungan yang ada sekarang pun mungkin saja akan hancur.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "original": "それは嫌だ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Aku tidak mau itu terjadi.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "original": "なら、男として意識されないでもいいのかと言われれば、それも嫌だし……どうしたものか。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Lalu, jika ditanya apakah aku rela tidak dianggap sebagai pria, aku juga tidak mau...... Aku harus bagaimana?",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "original": "「はぁぁぁ～……」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Haaaa~......」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "original": "@t35@d1「ほら、また。しあわせが逃げちゃいますよ。ため息の原因は何ですか？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t35@d1「Tuh, kan, hela napas lagi. Nanti kebahagiaannya kabur lho. Sebenarnya apa sih yang bikin Nii-san menghela napas？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "original": "「それは……別に、何でもいいだろ。お前には関係のない話だよ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Itu... bukan apa-apa kok. Gak ada hubungannya sama kamu」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "original": "@t18@d1@t18@d2「関係ないって……むぅ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t18@d1@t18@d2「Gak ada hubungannya katanya... hmmph」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "original": "言えるわけないだろ？",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Mana mungkin aku bisa mengatakannya？",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "original": "そら姉に男として意識されなさすぎて情けない、なんて。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Bahwa aku merasa menyedihkan karena Sora-nee sama sekali tidak menganggapku sebagai seorang pria.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "original": "@t50@d1「そういう態度を取るのなら、いいです。自分で考えます。……今日の兄さんは、朝食の時もなんだか様子がおかしかったんですよね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t50@d1「Kalau Nii-san bersikap begitu, ya sudah. Biar aku pikirkan sendiri. ...Hari ini Nii-san kelihatan aneh sejak waktu sarapan tadi, kan?」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "original": "「そうか？いつもどおりだったと思うけど」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Masa？ Perasaan aku bersikap seperti biasa saja」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "original": "さすがに食事中までため息をつくなんてことはしていなかったはずだ。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Seingatku aku tidak sampai menghela napas saat sedang makan.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "original": "「そんなことありません。だって、そら姉の『あーん』に変な反応してたじゃないですか」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Enggak kok. Buktinya, tadi Nii-san bereaksi aneh waktu Sora-nee mau menyuapi 'aa~n', kan?」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "original": "こ、こいつ、鋭いところを指摘してきやがる。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "S-si anak ini, tajam banget kalau nunjuk poin masalah.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "original": "「いつもの兄さんなら、普通にそら姉の『あーん』を受け入れてました」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Biasanya Nii-san pasti bakal terima-terima saja disuapi Sora-nee」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "original": "「お、俺だって断る時くらいあるだろ」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「A-aku juga bisa menolak sesekali, kan?」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "original": "「確かにありますね」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Memang benar sih」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "original": "「だろ？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Kan？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "original": "@t30@d1「でも、それは外のことですよね？学園とか、『月見団子』とか。人目がある時だけです」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t30@d1「Tapi itu biasanya kalau di luar rumah, kan？ Di sekolah, atau di 'Tsukimi Dango'. Hanya kalau ada orang lain saja」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "original": "ぐっ――こいつ、本当に鋭いな！？",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Guh-dia benar-benar tajam！",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "original": "「と、とにかく、今日はそういう気分じゃなかったってだけだって」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「Pokoknya, hari ini aku cuma lagi gak mood saja」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "original": "@t40@d1「そうやって言い訳するところが、むしろ怪しすぎます。……兄さんの反応がおかしいのは、そら姉に関係している？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t40@d1「Cari-cari alasan begitu malah bikin makin mencurigakan. ...Apa reaksi aneh Nii-san ini ada hubungannya dengan Sora-nee？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "original": "「……なるほど、そういうことですか」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「......Jadi begitu, ya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "original": "「な、何がだ？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「A-apa maksudmu？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "original": "@t25@d1@t52@d2「……別に、何でもありませんよ？……さぁて、と。ふぅ、暑いですねー」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "@t25@d1@t52@d2「......Nggak ada apa-apa kok？ ......Yah. Duh, panas banget ya」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "original": "ふいに立ち上がった二乃が、服の胸元をぱたぱた動かして、艶めかしい鎖骨とか魅惑の谷間をチラチラさせる。",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino tiba-tiba berdiri sambil mengibaskan kerah bajunya, memperlihatkan sekilas tulang selangka yang molek dan belahan dada yang memikat.",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "original": "昔の俺なら思わず視線が吸い寄せられていただろうけど、今の俺はぴくりとも反応しな……いや、しない、しないぞ！",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Jika itu aku yang dulu, pandanganku pasti sudah tersedot ke sana tanpa sadar, tapi aku yang sekarang nggak akan bereaksi sedikit pun... nggak, nggak akan, aku nggak akan tergoda！",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "original": "一登",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Ichito",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "original": "「……はぁ、二乃。そういうの家でやる分にはいいけど、外ではやるなよ？」",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "「......Haa, Nino. Nggak apa-apa kalau kamu melakukan itu di rumah, tapi jangan lakukan di luar, ya？」",
            "machine": "",
            "better": "",
            "best": "",
            "polished": ""
        }
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "original": "二乃",
        "translations": {
            "initial": "Nino",
            "machine": "",
